// Deployment settings for Cloudflare Workers Builds.
//
// The site is plain static files at the repository root, served as Workers
// static assets. Cloudflare infers that for production deploys, but builds of
// other branches run `wrangler versions upload`, which cannot, and failed with
// "Missing entry-point to Worker script or to assets directory". Declaring it
// here makes both kinds of build explicit.
//
// The name must stay "writeitdownripitup". It has to match the Worker in the
// Cloudflare dashboard, which is the one the custom domain is attached to; a
// different name would deploy to a different Worker. Which files in the
// directory are actually uploaded is decided by .assetsignore.
{
  "name": "writeitdownripitup",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-11",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./"
  }
}
